                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2fafcea2-d526-467d-81ee-92d8a04920af",
                        "source_entry_id": "15179c34-4cd1-357f-85a8-19a52c06f36d",
                        "source_sense_id": "1a8d4082-b50c-360a-8508-fc059d02e764",
                        "source_sense_description": "eine auf einem Hochseil vorgeführte Akrobatik",
                        "target_lang_word": "tightrope act",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4f07ed15-6f9d-4e1d-9980-50943efcfc50",
                        "source_entry_id": "15179c34-4cd1-357f-85a8-19a52c06f36d",
                        "source_sense_id": "1a8d4082-b50c-360a-8508-fc059d02e764",
                        "source_sense_description": "eine auf einem Hochseil vorgeführte Akrobatik",
                        "target_lang_word": "tightrope walk",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tightrope walk",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "028dbb5b-de4e-3e7b-ae7b-91a6901359a2",
                                        "entry_id": "dcdf3298-b4bb-3ac4-8420-67698a6558eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of walking on a tightrope."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72b49d4c-ece9-4009-bedb-1722f81dfbb0",
                                                "sense_id": "028dbb5b-de4e-3e7b-ae7b-91a6901359a2",
                                                "text": "Stunts like tightrope walks and barrel plunges were later banned at the falls, with fines of up to $10,000."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b34b0494-1701-4958-96ee-2c5b44e4f032",
                                                "sense_id": "028dbb5b-de4e-3e7b-ae7b-91a6901359a2",
                                                "text": "In 1859, French acrobat Charles Blondin dazzled Americans with his tightrope walks, the most famous of which were his repeated crossings of Niagara Falls."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "538d9186-2d50-4c17-8601-07ce69eb28aa",
                                                "sense_id": "028dbb5b-de4e-3e7b-ae7b-91a6901359a2",
                                                "text": "As for the Logan siblings, Kendall likens his latest showdown with his father to “a tightrope walk on a straight razor ... Five-hundred-foot reputational drop.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "054d045a-5f75-3eef-9316-0a963bb18091",
                                        "entry_id": "dcdf3298-b4bb-3ac4-8420-67698a6558eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A perilous course between alternatives."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5780935-8c24-4f5d-81e9-5bdb0392479f",
                                                "sense_id": "054d045a-5f75-3eef-9316-0a963bb18091",
                                                "text": "Not since Philippe Petit stepped onto a wire surreptitiously rigged between the towers of the late, lamented World Trade Center in 1974 has there been a tightrope walk as perilous and as public as Ivanka Trump’s."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "404c4c02-89b7-4468-9954-ac45644c9431",
                                                "sense_id": "054d045a-5f75-3eef-9316-0a963bb18091",
                                                "text": "Mr. Donofrio's strategy is a tightrope walk. He is trying to preserve as much of the traditional mainframe business as possible, while remaking the big machines, replacing their large, power-hungry processors with more efficient computer-on-a-chip microprocessors, which drive work stations and personal computers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14435190-e959-4141-b5d6-8149fac1239b",
                                                "sense_id": "054d045a-5f75-3eef-9316-0a963bb18091",
                                                "text": "The RSS mouthpiece, meanwhile, termed this as a historical opportunity but cautioned that running the government would be a tightrope walk. “Though running this government will be a tightrope walk, especially for the PDP, if interests of the people of J&K are kept in mind, this will be a historic opportunity,” said the Organiser, adding “keeping away from the pressures of separatist tendencies, focusing completely on development and providing transparency in governance would be key in this regard.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tightrope walk",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c50db2e0-20d1-32a2-888e-04a1fff518ca",
                                        "entry_id": "5bcdfcb9-6de8-3a2a-ad56-df2bd194fea1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of tightrope-walk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "560a038e-c56f-4279-802b-1e5ca233db99",
                                                "sense_id": "c50db2e0-20d1-32a2-888e-04a1fff518ca",
                                                "text": "John Glass, 23 years old, a waiter, of 716 Lafayette Avenue, Brooklyn, put the commando training he learned as a soldier to use yesterday, according to the police of the Bergen Street Station, who said that he scaled a one-story brick building, tightrope walked along a cornice, forced down a window and entered Riche's Jewelry Shop at 362 Livingston Street."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57d05204-00c5-4db6-ac00-906bc8a547fd",
                                                "sense_id": "c50db2e0-20d1-32a2-888e-04a1fff518ca",
                                                "text": "One boy tried to tightrope walk through the fountain until he was tugged back by a friend."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c4956cd-e764-438e-82f2-911a543ab5ce",
                                                "sense_id": "c50db2e0-20d1-32a2-888e-04a1fff518ca",
                                                "text": "Set in New York in 1974, as Philippe Petit tightrope walks between the newly built Twin Towers, it tells of interlocking lives in the world below, from a radical Irish monk in the Bronx to an Upper East Side housewife."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
